SUMMARY:Firestarter Vol 2: A Celebration of Alternative Queer Black and Brown Aesthetics - Durham
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable night at “”Firestarter Vol 2: A Celebration of Alternative Queer Black and Brown Aesthetics – Durham”” at The Pinhook! This vibrant venue\, known for its eclectic atmosphere and welcoming vibe\, will come alive with performances that celebrate the rich tapestry of alternative queer culture. Expect a night filled with powerful artistry\, captivating music\, and a community spirit that embraces diversity and creativity. \nWhether you’re a long-time supporter of queer aesthetics or simply curious to explore new sounds and perspectives\, this event promises to be a transformative experience. Come together with fellow art enthusiasts and be part of a celebration that uplifts and honors the voices of Black and Brown artists. Don’t miss out on this chance to ignite your passion for alternative culture—grab your tickets now and be part of the magic at The Pinhook!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/firestarter-vol-2-a-celebration-of-alternative-queer-black-and-brown-aesthetics-durham/
LOCATION:The Pinhook\, 117 W Main St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Firestarter-Vol-2-A-Celebration-of-Alternative-Queer-Black-and-Brown-Aesthetics.jpg
