SUMMARY:SHARK WEEK Hoo Ha Ha
DESCRIPTION:All week – shark week screenings\, themed cocktails\, photobooth\, carnival game\, snack bags\, & more! \nCome to the shark side & celebrate Shark Week at DSSOLVR! All day all week: \nSunday\, July 26th – Saturday\, August 1st \n– Shark week on the TVs all week! (play some free shark week bingo cards or color some shark themed coloring pages while you watch – adults like to color too :)\n– Jaw-some themed cocktails & jello-shots\n– Fin-omenal photobooth (become the shark)\n– Goth the Munchies? We will have Shark Snack Bags! (a variety box of ocean themed sweets available all week until sold out)\n– Sink or Swim Carnival Game – Pick one of the rubber sharks from the mini pool on the bar and see if you win a prize! (One free play per person per day – must be over 21 yrs old to play & win! – some prizes may contain alcohol wink)
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/shark-week-hoo-ha-ha/2026-07-26/
