SUMMARY:Sunday Set with DJ Gemynii
DESCRIPTION:Summer Sundays belong to Sunday Set on the Roof — join us for the next one\, July 26\, from 5 to 10 PM. DJ Gemynii on the decks from 5 to 8 PM\, fresh oysters for $2\, spritzes you create yourself for $10\, and skyline views that remind you why you love Durham. \nWhat to Expect \nLive DJ Sets | 5 to 8 PM Rotating resident DJs. No cover\, just good music on a rooftop.\nBuild-Your-Own Spritz Bar | $10 Choose your spirit base. Add house-made syrups and fresh citrus. Pick your sparkling wine or soda. Top with herbs and fruit.\n$2 Oysters Rotating selection of fresh North Carolina oysters\nSnack Board | $18 Veggie crudité\, Old Bay chips with house-made ranch\, seasonal popcorn\, roasted nuts. Sunday Set Keychain holders know: The snack board is complimentary.\nFree and open to all. No reservations needed.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/sunday-set-with-dj-gemynii-2/
